CTF (Capture The Flag) musobaqasidagi bu vazifalar real kiberxavfsizlik ssenariylariga asoslangan. Siz keltirgan topshiriqlar "Penetration Testing" (Kirib borishni sinovdan o'tkazish) bosqichlariga juda mos tushadi.

HackTheBox (HTB) va TryHackMe (THM) platformalarida ushbu ko'nikmalarni shakllantirish uchun quyidagi laboratoriya va yo'llarni (Paths) tavsiya qilaman:

-----

### 1\. FTP Serveridan ma'lumotlarni aniqlash

Bu odatda "Enumeration" bosqichi hisoblanadi. Ko'pincha ochiq qolgan `anonymous` login orqali amalga oshiriladi.

  * **TryHackMe:** [Pickle Rick](https://tryhackme.com/room/picklerick) yoki [Basic Pentesting](https://tryhackme.com/room/basicpentestingjt) (FTP orqali ma'lumot qidirishni o'rgatadi).
  * **HackTheBox:** [Fawn](https://app.hackthebox.com/machines/Fawn) (Juda sodda FTP o'rganish uchun).

### 2\. Kuzatuv kamerasiga ruxsat olish

Bu IoT (Internet of Things) qurilmalaridagi zaifliklarni topish bilan bog'liq.

  * **TryHackMe:** [IoT Hacking](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://tryhackme.com/room/iothacking) xonasi.
  * **HackTheBox:** [Tactics](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://app.hackthebox.com/machines/Tactics) yoki Shodan orqali qidiruv metodlarini o'rgatuvchi darsliklar.

### 3\. Mail serverni buzish va yozishmalarni olish

SMTP, POP3 yoki IMAP protokollarini o'rganishni talab qiladi.

  * **TryHackMe:** [Network Services](https://tryhackme.com/room/networkservices) (SMTP qismini ko'ring).
  * **HackTheBox:** [Irked](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://app.hackthebox.com/machines/Irked) yoki [SolidState](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://app.hackthebox.com/machines/SolidState) (Mail serverdagi zaifliklar va yozishmalarni o'qish bo'yicha klassik mashina).

### 4\. Axborot tizimiga kirish va rejalardan xabardor bo'lish

Bu umumiy "Web Application Hacking" va "Privilege Escalation"ni o'z ichiga oladi.

  * **TryHackMe:** [Jr Penetration Tester](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://tryhackme.com/path/outline/jrpentester) yo'li.
  * **HackTheBox:** [Tier 1](https://app.hackthebox.com/starting-point) dagi mashinalar (Appointment, Sequel).

### 5\. Maxfiy tizim serveri va Administrator huquqini olish (PrivEsc)

Tizimga kirgandan so'ng oddiy foydalanuvchidan "Root" yoki "Administrator" darajasiga ko'tarilish.

  * **TryHackMe:** [Linux PrivEsc](https://tryhackme.com/room/linuxprivesc) va [Windows PrivEsc](https://tryhackme.com/room/windowsprivesc20).
  * **HackTheBox:** [Academy: Linux Privilege Escalation](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://academy.hackthebox.com/module/details/51) moduli.

-----

### Tavsiya etilgan aniq ketma-ketlik (O'rganish rejasi)

Agar musobaqaga tayyorlanmoqchi bo'lsangiz, quyidagi tartibda harakat qiling:

1.  **Fundamental Bilimlar (THM):** "Pre-Security" va "Complete Beginner" yo'llarini tugating.
2.  **Tarmoq Xavfsizligi:** "Network Services" (FTP, SMTP, SSH o'rganish uchun).
3.  **Exploitation:** Metasploit va qo'lda ekspluatatsiya qilishni o'rganing.
4.  **HTB Starting Point:** HTB dagi "Starting Point" mashinalarini (Tier 0 dan Tier 2 gacha) birma-bir yopib chiqing. U yerda aynan siz aytgan FTP va Administrator huquqini olish mavzulari bor.

> **Eslatma:** CTF musobaqalarida ballar (masalan, 1600, 1900) topshiriqning murakkabligini bildiradi. 1900 ballik vazifa odatda "Active Directory"ni buzish yoki murakkab "Buffer Overflow" hujumini talab qilishi mumkin.

Sizga ushbu vazifalardan birontasi (masalan, FTP orqali kirish) bo'yicha aniq konsol buyruqlari yoki metodologiya kerakmi?
